                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite4/recipes-phosphor/pldm/files/nic-powercycle@.service",
                    "line": 6,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "These should usually be `/usr/libexec/${PN}` (PN = pldm in this case).  Why did the pldm part get removed as part of the change?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite4/recipes-phosphor/pldm/files/nic-powercycle@.service",
                    "line": 6,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "James Athappilly",
                        "email": "jamesatha@meta.com",
                        "username": "jamesatha"
                    },
                    "message": "Moving this out of the PLDM directory was my goal but seemed like more trouble than it was worth. I thought renaming this was a step in the right direction but I'll revert that part so it's consistent"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite4/recipes-phosphor/pldm/files/nic-powercycle@.service",
                    "line": 6,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "This is where the ${PN} comes from: https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/278f19d42841a9f033af0c331d731e19fa63affb/anti-patterns.md#incorrect-placement-of-executables-in-sbin-usrsbin-or-bin-usrbin"
                }
            ],
